Keep a shared neighbors as 0.

To count from row (a whole number) with column (a whole number).
Set neighbors to 0.
For every step from 0 to 7.
The r is row plus item step of rowsteps.
The c is column plus item step of colsteps.
If r is at least 0 and r is less than 4 and c is at least 0 and c is less than 3 and item (r times 3 plus c) of board is 1, add 1 to neighbors.

The future is a list of 12 zeros.
For every cell from 0 to 11.
The row is cell divided by 3.
The column is cell modulo 3.
Count from row with column.
The live is item cell of board.
The nextvalue is 0.
If live is 1 and neighbors is at least 2 and neighbors is at most 3, set nextvalue to 1.
If live is 1 and neighbors is less than 2, set nextvalue to 0.
If live is 1 and neighbors is more than 3, set nextvalue to 0.
If live is 0 and neighbors is 3, set nextvalue to 1.
Set item cell of future to nextvalue.

For each value in future, show value.
